NG__section\"><div class=\"WhyChooseUsSection-module-scss-module__65YJNG__container\"><div class=\"WhyChooseUsSection-module-scss-module__65YJNG__grid\"><div class=\"WhyChooseUsSection-module-scss-module__65YJNG__header\"><div class=\"SectionHeader-module-scss-module__J6xJhW__header SectionHeader-module-scss-module__J6xJhW__left\"><h2 class=\"SectionHeader-module-scss-module__J6xJhW__heading  \">Why Choose Us</h2><p class=\"SectionHeader-module-scss-module__J6xJhW__description\" style=\"max-width:300px\">We&#x27;re not just tour operators we&#x27;re your gateway to authentic Egyptian experiences</p></div><a class=\"Button-module-scss-module__VUJcyW__button Button-module-scss-module__VUJcyW__outline Button-module-scss-module__VUJcyW__md\" href=\"/about\"><span>About Us</span><span class=\"Button-module-scss-module__VUJcyW__icon\"><img alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" decoding=\"async\" data-nimg=\"1\" style=\"color:transparent\" src=\"/images/arrows/arrow-right-blue.svg\"/></span></a></div><div class=\"WhyChooseUsSection-module-scss-module__65YJNG__card\" style=\"background-color:#10B98115\"><div class=\"WhyChooseUsSection-module-scss-module__65YJNG__iconBox\" style=\"color:#10B981\"><img alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" decoding=\"async\" data-nimg=\"1\" style=\"color:transparent\" src=\"/images/whychooseus/location.svg\"/></div><h3 class=\"WhyChooseUsSection-module-scss-module__65YJNG__cardTitle\" style=\"color:#10B981\">Local Experts</h3><p class=\"WhyChooseUsSection-module-scss-module__65YJNG__cardDesc\">Born and raised Egyptians who know every hidden gem</p></div><div class=\"WhyChooseUsSection-module-scss-module__65YJNG__card\" style=\"background-color:#FF660015\"><div class=\"WhyChooseUsSection-module-scss-module__65YJNG__iconBox\" style=\"color:#FF6600\"><img alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" decoding=\"async\" data-nimg=\"1\" style=\"color:transparent\" src=\"/images/whychooseus/airplane.svg\"/></div><h3 class=\"WhyChooseUsSection-module-scss-module__65YJNG__cardTitle\" style=\"color:#FF6600\">Flexible Custom Trips</h3><p class=\"WhyChooseUsSection-module-scss-module__65YJNG__cardDesc\">Design your dream journey with our personalized planning</p></div><div class=\"WhyChooseUsSection-module-scss-module__65YJNG__card\" style=\"background-color:#FF660015\"><div class=\"WhyChooseUsSection-module-scss-module__65YJNG__iconBox\" style=\"color:#FF6600\"><img alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" decoding=\"async\" data-nimg=\"1\" style=\"color:transparent\" src=\"/images/whychooseus/headphone.svg\"/></div><h3 class=\"WhyChooseUsSection-module-scss-module__65YJNG__cardTitle\" style=\"color:#FF6600\">24/7 Support</h3><p class=\"WhyChooseUsSection-module-scss-module__65YJNG__cardDesc\">Round-the-clock assistance wherever your adventure takes you</p></div><div class=\"WhyChooseUsSection-module-scss-module__65YJNG__card\" style=\"background-color:#2563EB15\"><div class=\"WhyChooseUsSection-module-scss-module__65YJNG__iconBox\" style=\"color:#2563EB\"><img alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" decoding=\"async\" data-nimg=\"1\" style=\"color:transparent\" src=\"/images/whychooseus/language-circle.svg\"/></div><h3 class=\"WhyChooseUsSection-module-scss-module__65YJNG__cardTitle\" style=\"color:#2563EB\">Multi-language Guides</h3><p class=\"WhyChooseUsSection-module-scss-module__65YJNG__cardDesc\">Expert guides fluent in 15+ languages, ensuring smooth communication.</p></div><div class=\"WhyChooseUsSection-module-scss-module__65YJNG__card\" style=\"background-color:#15366E15\"><div class=\"WhyChooseUsSection-module-scss-module__65YJNG__iconBox\" style=\"color:#15366E\"><img alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" decoding=\"async\" data-nimg=\"1\" style=\"color:transparent\" src=\"/images/whychooseus/star.svg\"/></div><h3 class=\"WhyChooseUsSection-module-scss-module__65YJNG__cardTitle\" style=\"color:#15366E\">Trusted by Thousands</h